notes: An LMBX (profile 0x10, bitstream v3: context-coded palette indices, palettes of up to 64 colours, exact edge alpha, quad tiles, DCT colour with an alpha palette) conformance vector covering palette tiles with and without edge alpha, quad tiles, flat tiles. decoded_rgba_q_sha256 is each frame's normative output — RGBA in quarter code values (0..=1020), width*height*4 u16 little endian, rows top first — as the reference decoder (dxvkit_plus_core::lmbx) produces it; every conforming decoder must reproduce it (docs/LMBD.md, "LMBX"). Our own procedural / hand-built content, no third-party content.
